#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:51
msgid ""
"OAK: Oh, for Pete's sake…\\nSo pushy, as always.\\p{B_PLAYER_NAME}.\\pYou've"
" never had a POKéMON battle\\nbefore, have you?\\pA POKéMON battle is when "
"TRAINERS\\npit their POKéMON against each\\lother.\\p"
msgstr ""
"CHEN: Oh, misère…\\nToujours aussi impatient!\\p{B_PLAYER_NAME}.\\pTu "
"n’avais encore jamais combattu\\navec des Pokémon, n’est-ce pas?\\pDans un "
"combat, les Dresseurs\\nlancent leurs Pokémon pour qu’ils\\lse battent entre"
" eux.\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:52
msgid ""
"OAK: Hm…\\nHow disappointing…\\pIf you win, you earn prize money,\\nand your"
" POKéMON grow.\\pBut if you lose, {B_PLAYER_NAME}, you end\\nup paying prize"
" money…\\pHowever, since you had no warning\\nthis time, I'll pay for "
"you.\\pBut things won't be this way once\\nyou step outside these "
"doors.\\pThat's why you must strengthen your\\nPOKéMON by battling wild "
"POKéMON.\\p"
msgstr ""
"CHEN: Hum…\\nC’est vraiment décevant…\\pSi tu gagnes, tu remportes "
"de\\nl’argent et tes Pokémon progressent.\\pMais si tu perds, tu dois "
"donner\\nde l’argent au vainqueur…\\p{B_PLAYER_NAME}, comme tu ne le "
"savais\\npas, je vais payer pour toi.\\pMais tu devras te débrouiller "
"sans\\nmoi une fois dehors.\\pC’est pour ça que tu dois entraîner\\ntes "
"Pokémon contre des sauvages.\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:53
msgid "OAK: Inflicting damage on the foe\\nis the key to any battle.\\p"
msgstr "CHEN: Infliger des dégâts à son\\nennemi est la clé de la victoire.\\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:54
msgid ""
"OAK: Keep your eyes on your\\nPOKéMON's HP.\\pIt will faint if the HP drops "
"to\\n“0.”\\p"
msgstr ""

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:55
msgid "OAK: Lowering the foe's stats\\nwill put you at an advantage.\\p"
msgstr ""

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:56
msgid "OAK: No! There's no running away\\nfrom a TRAINER POKéMON battle!\\p"
msgstr "CHEN: Non, on ne peut pas fuir\\nd’un combat contre un Dresseur!\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:57
msgid ""
"The TRAINER that makes the other\\nTRAINER's POKéMON faint by "
"lowering\\ltheir HP to “0,” wins.\\p"
msgstr ""
"Le Dresseur qui met K.O. tous les\\nPOKéMON adverses en réduisant leurs\\lPV"
" à “0” gagne le combat.\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:58
msgid ""
"But rather than talking about it,\\nyou'll learn more from experience.\\pTry"
" battling and see for yourself.\\p"
msgstr ""
"Mais assez parlé, rien ne vaut\\nla pratique!\\pEssaie donc un vrai "
"combat!\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:59
msgid ""
"OAK: Hm! Excellent!\\pIf you win, you earn prize money,\\nand your POKéMON "
"will grow!\\pBattle other TRAINERS and make\\nyour POKéMON strong!\\p"
msgstr ""
"CHEN: Hum! Excellent!\\pSi tu gagnes, tu remportes de\\nl’argent et tes "
"Pokémon progressent!\\pAffronte les autres Dresseurs\\npour endurcir tes "
"Pokémon!\\p"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:60
msgid "What will the\\nold man do?"
msgstr "Que va faire\\nle vieil homme?"

